deployed as:    a mise block in ~/.config/lazygit/config.yml
note:           Upstream's top-level theme:/authorColors: are nested under gui: here (lazygit reads
                gui.theme); otherwise identical. lazygit creates config.yml empty and never rewrites it.
                Own gui: settings go in this file, not a second top-level gui: (duplicate key).
                Bump: re-download themes/mocha/mauve.yml at the new commit, update commit here.
                Never hand-edit the vendored file.
